oud.dpfile.com/pc/w4Sv4yzt8Op7d7NRCGjlOwip2EmzzdfhvCDZDKP0HWr2a-S16Sj3VegA9-KO81fVElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/7O0ro9WnwaqFADEg7Cs9p0VamnB-iDeqb7SvO7WFGx7oEswSqAaRQBHReVGBiyvIElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/lctDeHP-nzfum6kE3ohdGX1wRMqDqtB3jWWAzphJ3wICDZV-CwC8_fgKSAJjVe-nElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3485383651","user":"i**","time":"10月4日","star":5,"text":"终于在假期去品尝了这家新加坡融合菜，环境清新典雅，咖喱牛腩酥软q弹，咖喱味道非常浓郁，鸡油饭色泽鲜丽，口感纯正，鸡肉也非常鲜嫩，「空心菜」得到了一致的好评，推荐","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3484504759","user":"匿**","time":"10月4日","star":5,"text":"吃过两次！性价比很高！鸡很好吃","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3483313591","user":"m**","time":"10月3日","star":5,"text":"目前和同事吃过最好吃的东南亚餐厅，「招牌去骨海南鸡」和「椒麻鸡胸肉」里的鸡肉都非常嫩，但是椒麻鸡缺了点咸味，让服务员加了一小碟酱油拌进去刚刚好。「星洲炒米粉」一般般，有点干巴，盐好像也没有完全拌匀。「鸡油饭」非常好吃，本身就有咸味。整体非常推荐。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/tv9XrsL-Dy-DtXYrFjMi_5RDQVl3KMCCFAq1QYzEpKypSCT9e8D0-TZ2OCWv0MvOElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3483184542","user":"杜**","time":"10月3日","star":3.5,"text":"日常工作餐常吃，鸡肉比较正宗，最近换了午市套餐形式，感觉像在吃盒饭，不如原来的分装形式好","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3482170748","user":"匿**","time":"10月3日","star":4.5,"text":"小馆挺有南洋风情，在陆悦天地木星负一楼的美食街上，位置好找，海南鸡饭有荤有素，鸡肉入口不腻，味道不错，打卡送了虾片也挺好吃，服务员态度挺好，主动上了宝宝餐具，柠檬水味道也挺浓郁的，陆悦天地里美食越来越多了。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/CyeK_bPqic_GFj8XafUEaDV9o7rR3_Z5_VbWquLZbz7q2ggxK-VAkfrMjsTTPq4ZElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/oiNA-Sm_dehB_avaFBVQZBT9eVxx3uDtt8f8GmUCThnqJuuM87DnC0uIVx2EpQU8Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/j331eLhThhK_QPzXk0txaZlc-1b-18REIkacfd65WcjqT_Y6g4dKKzrjfwAlzQ8kElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3481169908","user":"匿**","time":"10月2日","star":5,"text":"非常好吃 性价比超高的新加坡餐厅","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3480724928","user":"巴**","time":"10月2日","star":3.5,"text":"口味不错 就是餐厅没开空调以及风 就很热 \n「新加坡海南鸡饭」鸡油饭真的巨巨巨巨香 鸡的分量也很足够 套餐还送了鱼皮 很划算\n「新加坡叻沙粉」这个粉汤底很浓郁 就是粉本身没有怎么入味 但整体料还是很多的 一整晚主打一个啥都有 \n「椒麻鸡胸肉」这个椒麻味很足 鸡胸肉不柴 好吃的","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3479595892","user":"紫**","time":"10月1日","star":4.5,"text":"这家海南鸡饭真的超出预期。鸡皮薄而透亮，带着一层Q弹的皮冻，入口滑润完全不油腻。鸡肉嫩而不柴，汁水锁在肉里，能吃出鸡肉本身的清甜。灵魂当属鸡油饭，用鸡汤和鸡油焖煮，米粒粒粒分明，油香浓郁却不会腻口，空口吃都很香。搭配三份蘸料，姜蓉醇厚鲜爽，辣椒酱带着青柠的清新酸香，黑酱油咸甜柔和，不同蘸料能吃出不一样的风味。","likes":0,"images":["https://p0.meituan.net/ugcpic/fe04397324cdeb7970722232b1be66b4615007.jpg%401080w_1080h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp","https://p0.meituan.net/ugcpic/02ddec21a94743eda5fb6b18a59e3fd9687408.jpg%401080w_1080h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp","https://p0.meituan.net/ugcpic/8b9dd2f6a3700fb9a4ac0649253cfb34785580.jpg%401080w_1080h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp"]},{"id":"3479381084","user":"S**","time":"10月1日","star":5,"text":"午餐打卡了新吉小馆，点了两份套餐。\n第一次吃新加坡叻沙汤粉，它的汤底椰香浓郁，微辣带鲜，配了三只罗氏虾，蛤蜊量很足，米粉吸汤入味，配冻柠茶刚好解腻；\n招牌的海南鸡饭套餐鸡皮滑嫩，鸡肉不柴，配上店内三色特色蘸料很提味，选了鸡油饭，粒粒分明、油香十足，同样配冻柠茶清爽解渴。\n两份套餐分量适中，上菜速度可以，环境干净。整体性价比高，工作日午餐选它挺省心。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Vpvt4xTyEpULZQHn4G_jG2a421n2vVAlpHPUps-s98dVJroNCL-BPFlHNuEvC9u5Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/bxH0QZ5f8QRAX5Drs9BkhjvWL9zuINQEt6PwfzRO2TZeYxwq4ZOQ2FpFZ-JTb8PmElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/nnRjrs8WCwvPu21mI_q6BMxauAT7_uxQSQQQmK01vkkT6EEcLnakOThwTQTnzsBcElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/BWvGjTXRHlH2u3F4nixul8DI9gyAdDm4fCRaMNgfEFLrJVRXEPKydZPy9iQf2mLsElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3478705813","user":"7**","time":"10月1日","star":3.5,"text":"「招牌去骨海南鸡」鸡肉非常滑嫩，三种蘸料口味丰富。黄「黄咖喱牛腩」咖喱浓郁，牛腩软糯，汤汁拌米饭超绝，「鸡油饭」米粒油润鲜香，颗粒分明。「马来风光」炒空心菜脆嫩，很有南洋风味。再来两杯冻柠茶和奶茶清爽解腻","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Jz7ohFulusMc5BogWh2L56Vpn_xcUrGPb7KUcsxF29zklvs-mRu_-lMBm_LTYsLgElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/HiaUVrsBhq7tsIWGGWI6oZcMcr2jsjSzNkRNNZXvmbaslsd818H5i55cbhBsAkD7Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/zyjhqSjH1zXS44ubEY-dt1uZz2S83_gIMVmyggmg4kXoEswSqAaRQBHReVGBiyvIElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/LIDWexWZcf8yf-DwQJQ364-BuyVto_ar3zGA-fNHsJ8lPC9eOYWA4SOzX3qdbI-DElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3476768999","user":"一**","time":"9月30日","star":4.5,"text":"朋友中的霸王餐，是一份双人套餐。招牌海南鸡饭，味道淡淡的嫩嫩的，一点儿也不腻，蘸蘸酱味道好。另外又点了一份「空心菜」。看着好像东西不多，但是分量都很足。饮料、米饭、菜品均是。我们吃饱了却都没有吃完哈哈。然后我俩一致认为也很适合健身啊减脂的选手们吃，非常健康没有负担喔！这家店人气还挺旺，饭点基本满位","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/8_OxeZbznV4S_wnzTU1y-F2JQLwhea9MOBLQPXJuMVzPrCgmK_R3zLHnOWEB1I4wElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/iuoAAmP6M-FbsnO9O9oTQu-EnR4l5quSarGJpC3TrZR6SaruGGhWtS4uQSic4C9kElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/DST99mf0PwLMiawrwm_b9zsLG4vpByXXWd_yCamNKvy7H9AxA4c66i2BD7V-UpevElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/wyFoTO31BgpFV-JcRlFz_5U_DoKzwXlqldlbvkBMrDQ-3Fw1CfNMVEWhKbJUSN3FElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3474450398","user":"夏**","time":"9月29日","star":5,"text":"很好 环境很好 味道喜欢 经常过来吃","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3473569336","user":"E**","time":"9月29日","star":5,"text":"海南鸡饭很不错，皮包柔嫩，配蘸料很香，下次还来","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3473257068","user":"找**","time":"9月29日","star":4.5,"text":"交通挺方便的，13号线直达，客人不是很多，不用等位，「招牌去骨海南鸡」鸡肉挺嫩的，味道不错，「黄咖喱牛腩」量挺大，喜欢吃咖喱的可以直接冲。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/j7Rt4y2ttueMvLduVgEH-QykhvMLRvwk1eyRYVpXiuTaUbFyWWUB2ISuDe4O976rElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3472218614","user":"北**","time":"9月28日","star":4,"text":"环境简约，开在木星下面，和闺蜜狂累了就来吃一下，招牌海南鸡口感不错，咖喱、空心菜等菜味道在线。性价比尚可，适合日常便饭。饭点人多需要等位，上菜速度会变慢。人均50左右，价格实惠，整体口味偏融合，想吃清淡新加坡菜可以来尝试哦。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/0D9dJejQDOONETZYgNEh4Qpm353Mo5KZyMhu5vcTAV-5Qip0cYsJT_ou6EU5881rElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/nbDaiLkvH6iwCbFTuAbElUoLUMwUFC2jfPR5Sxd6gkpXThinpDFrWRFipjtP0HhoElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/GKQFoManMGRxH7Rc6tHMKKS0g2uMjZSST7Fz2E4w8lv4Mvi6BZ6o7MAu9B41_5xSElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3472168442","user":"匿**","time":"9月28日","star":5,"text":"这家新加坡菜馆风味很地道，融合南洋多元特色。海南鸡皮滑肉嫩，鸡饭油润飘香；叻沙椰香浓郁，香料层次丰富。菜品酸甜辣平衡，还原本地风味。店内环境简约舒服，上菜速度尚可，服务周到。性价比不错，适合朋友小聚，想吃正宗南洋风味值得一试。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3471220745","user":"欣**","time":"9月28日","star":4.5,"text":"套餐挺划算的，「招牌去骨海南鸡」嫩滑无骨，牙口不好的也可以吃。「黄咖喱牛腩」喜欢吃咖喱的可以直接冲。","likes":1,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/IToSorEsV3XUXFQEYa_OiHufOjtltNAraK5IxcM9quWb2PGasOeHASrYd3A4QodwElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/J8QkIu-3qpJzGzgbnBYwQ72RZRmkIihrhSzhjUQu1uwpkan3-TfkYbblclbhSmk_Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/wsLtRZiuPanKaYoOJEbU8icZZUrbdBdu0fmHyutE_s8KCEVPJlDbGkQ6y1ArNq8aElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/WigjnttCF1rIm8085jHz-p2Wf6yyUfqQEcegIjKywb9fdXyEWUi1ET5t8Ap_qt5dElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3470228918","user":"匿**","time":"9月27日","star":4.5,"text":"想尝试东南亚菜的朋友可以试试，休息日中午人不算太多～套餐整体比较划算，适合当工作餐～「鸡油饭」很香，泰奶有点甜，柠檬茶几乎没什么甜味主要是柠檬的涩味。烤猪颈肉的片切得很薄，但是整体份量不大，摆盘比较精致。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/vGbgBluAYkYoK1ETJU7q36sNfSxKoMQ6Je7eZL7coEUQDdtJHKM76-RkSyJTncDNElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/om8jkZOKqO7wDKVa3hLK5koPZ-2Izz_hgqOV23nx-NeOqaUMCrfrhV3dSyf6Rm8sElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3470010618","user":"聚**","time":"9月27日","star":4,"text":"距离上次来新吉小馆有段时间啦，甚是想念，这次中午正好有空就来了，团购了一份套餐性价比蛮高的是橙V专享价「黄咖喱牛腩」牛腩量足，酱香口入味，「鸡油饭」色泽金黄，颗粒饱满，「香兰椰汁糕」椰香浓郁，精致小巧「炸虾片」打卡福利，去骨海南鸡是招牌必点，有兴趣的小伙伴们可以来试试哈。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Vma2NkX-SyOWzL8-5oDttm6MnGkqynjir7xAx2-FGHeiQkEVP7chh0tHPRu3aZcjElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/63eSfpsIPStkxeOBEfLlwFvE0SotbeEDt6_I9MUZW4kHYMYCfm89uvOWQ9oEeh3qElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/ZSK8cWIN_u3DfCkM7M22D8Ey84tnqg6oMow2OVubZfTVioFBOc86zK7McbJTQG8HElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/V0DJeoTuxgDrx3CtnupcI92DJpB9rAj1HzotyWydgQwnMTSshExi2dEV03OUh4_hElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3469959096","user":"六**","time":"9月27日","star":5,"text":"其他的才都可以，这个「虾头膏豆腐饭」，难吃的很。虽然汤色金黄，但是完全没有味道，几乎等于白水煮豆腐","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Y2WV6kWV0YhwHO0dZwDGvNgfoTeRaU24ajBAxeqcgfA_nhOUBifiGyW7FmnEkYvoElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3469900186","user":"桃**","time":"9月27日","star":5,"text":"路过陆悦天地，在楼下看到了星级小馆，好像上海很多地方都有它的连锁店来做一下。店里的装修有南洋的风格，他们的肉骨茶还有罗氏虾，味道挺正宗的，下次应该还会再来吃。家里人都很喜欢这里的风格，谢谢的招待，我会孩子的。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/Tg0QpKIkz61fLNjDsomcwqK4JV-wapu9IwbVt_ZSQSIvoLnd9Y8Ti96XyNMANnc0Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/N_FJPYfO6KBeuDWm60A2t225jQG5AwHTryNq8roMB9p9oubFoaycQ0LcQ7MqPJirElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/8cDtaUrSumY0KEvKvos4lbz9C-CskAnCB68X6Adtb4wXzsJ68RQ3aGkfJvHQAFUlElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/0KAJtLMc2JqrY-7qer-FICQpxR-86696ChRR4ByyZurLF63Iiymxfmi8Ymq70ojjElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3469364497","user":"不**","time":"9月27日","star":5,"text":"香\n店内是清新雅致的南洋风格装修，绿植环绕搭配木质桌椅和暖黄灯光，随手拍照都挺出片，适合情侣约会或闺蜜聚餐。‌","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/sxHZb7cQJWDnzT05ogBQeO9QJpwsGOygsR3f9blnUkfNQj6PUpFZS0-xpvl4A9sCElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3466595128","user":"拜**","time":"9月25日","star":4,"text":"新吉小馆是主打新马泰融合风的南洋小馆，点评爸爸上面一百多的双人套餐性价比很不错。 招牌去骨海南鸡皮亮肉嫩、一抿脱骨，配姜葱酱、辣椒酱、黑酱油三味蘸料；黄咖喱牛腩拌饭一绝。 马来风光是喜欢的炒空心菜。服务态度很好，晚上不喝茶了，请小哥套餐里的饮料换成虾饼也很爽气的答应了。但是虾饼上来篮子底部一层巨油，有点拉胯。","likes":0,"images":["https://p0.meituan.net/ugcpic/d600c55895832b12a5c423bc681e666a668055.jpg%401080w_1080h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp","https://p0.meituan.net/ugcpic/7a451682c063973fc83fabfefd553632323840.jpg%401080w_1080h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp","https://p0.meituan.net/ugcpic/7ab8224a5d3d97082ac4da0440cc4a0a1072192.jpg%401080w_1080h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp"]},{"id":"3466487471","user":"s**","time":"9月25日","star":3.5,"text":"我当时买了两份海南鸡饭，坐着等打包回家吃。当时一个男服务员见我坐下就想着倒一杯水，结果旁边接单的阻止了，用我能听到的声音说她是打包的，我想问的是就一杯茶水，等着打包的人坐着等也不配喝一口水了么？可以想象企业文化是什么样的了，以后不会再去吃","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3465556315","user":"匿**","time":"9月25日","star":4.5,"text":"新吉小馆，整体体验平平。位置不太好找，但是电梯口下来就是，上菜速度很快，不用久等，旁边桌几个人都选了套餐，出餐效率很高。菜品属于中规中矩的水平，没有踩雷但也没有特别惊艳的亮点。套餐搭配比较齐全，能吃饱，性价比尚可。环境干净简单，适合日常简餐、工作吃饭，追求惊喜口味的话期望值不用太高，随便吃吃是没问题的。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/aAaupZupQPE8u7mLcsG6LcCUInTFt3rorhkqprk24qy40sNkxHoWxDSVkpCvwA8yElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/NwnIXA6Y1jNC7uGXpHIILXkIilEoSclWFIkcLFN62Htgdba2yeMsJc8kDkidKbwBElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3465316842","user":"大**","time":"9月24日","star":4,"text":"陆悦天地木星负一层里面都是餐饮店，这家小店大约有二十桌4人位，海南鸡饭，一份大约有1/4的海南鸡切块，配了3根白灼芥兰，5片黄瓜，还有一点三口味的蘸料，有甜面酱，甜辣酱，韭花酱，还有满满一碗的黄色的油亮油亮的鸡油拌饭，一份饭吃的非常饱，还配了一杯柠檬茶。味道一般，属于快餐类。","likes":0,"images":["https://p0.meituan.net/coverpic/0767a78bbc7d59d9eda06dd7596d77fb222026.jpg%40400w_400h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/0j5RQ-de1LpWrLZxmffi5nAlxa-ScgdYYWgjT022EHl8MLbdedcbsCYB4pwQc3AzElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/9zLXtq8Bvf6369f-xwPAzR9wa84Cpa2ewJJSlgDOBAJ2y4gWwnQJHxN86zIaW-vYElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/pU4jXLn1SDg_Mon13luK11wYD411g0pYbWswSBSLLNyGCzF127wkjybM8OqxpXVgElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3464625803","user":"匿**","time":"9月24日","star":5,"text":"近日探访了附近一家主打新加坡炒米粉的小店，整体体验令人愉悦。米粉炒得干爽蓬松，根根分明，带着锅气却毫不油腻。配料中的鲜虾仁弹牙，鸡蛋碎与豆芽、韭菜的搭配清爽解腻，最点睛的是那勺参巴辣酱，微辣中透着虾干鲜香，拌开后又添一层复合风味。店家还贴心附上青柠角，挤汁后酸香更提食欲。分量适中，女生吃刚好，男生可加份炸鱼饼。环境是典型街坊铺头，干净亮堂，老板会热情询问口味偏好。价格约50元，算实在。若想体验地道又不过分浓重的南洋炒粉，这家值得专程一试。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/ncp-tuQ4doZw-g-qs1nclm89KwvPhMxQGwzffTQMffP3k6DmkacyO7DhBzmwQOkbElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3464225845","user":"王**","time":"9月24日","star":5,"text":"团购的橙v券，味道还行比较清淡，鸡肉是凉的，菜也不热，送的喝的口味还是挺不错的，也是加冰的，整体吃起来有点儿冷。鸡油米饭是热的，味道也是很不错的。送的三个蘸料是一个酱油一个酸辣味一个青椒酱，但是都不辣，整体清淡，鸡皮比较肥","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/qFeK6HhqCsnU0UYY-f4VSK9as7uGqPUgEAwK5A4966qZ0xR3ShwOv4GKfvCLMyu2Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/TTfyQ8rwA3UOyB2EeYSB6BwQpVPS65VVCnKJilua8XB5vCBHXoZKqYdZtplSofAEElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/ApQm5bXPGbNHupnrtgFKz75Mjtszjx8-3n42RLQv16h__3lfVCuePLBufc5tVVYHElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3463121555","user":"E**","time":"9月23日","star":5,"text":"难吃难吃难吃！！！\n肉骨茶只有酱油的味道，齁咸，一点肉骨茶的味道都没有，我加了半杯水下去还是很咸，简直就是酱油汤！！！","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3462767677","user":"獨**","time":"9月23日","star":5,"text":"张江陆悦天地这家星际小馆体验不错，店内环境干净舒服。菜品口味在线，食材新鲜，上菜速度适中，服务热情。性价比尚可，适合工作日简餐，下次还会再来。","likes":0,"images":["https://p0.meituan.net/ugcpic/4a19dd55d47f8be9bcd8149a0ca687f4718020.jpg%401080w_1080h_1e_1l%7Cwatermark%3D0.webp"]},{"id":"3462515264","user":"天**","time":"9月23日","star":3.5,"text":"整体属于普通快餐水准，没有特别惊艳的亮点。最大优点是出餐速度很快，不用长时间等候。口味和口感只能算中规中矩，没有让人印象深刻的出彩之处，但也不会踩雷难吃。我点的泰式菠萝炒饭，黄油香气很充足，米饭带着香甜风味，整体是好吃的。缺点是黄油偏重，连续多吃几口之后会产生明显的油腻感，适合浅尝。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/_3NJqmfkvKjx_364t-dAm2vKDUASmlXgxDvSaFTiD742Vjb5915llVjv5IC0sqw9Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/uCVxc5PfaDl4edsVgguGMcnX7YQD4rul1aWuwZcESiiFlHD6E_DBd9RXWqibIPqNElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3461457433","user":"浅**","time":"9月22日","star":4.5,"text":"大头虾冬阴功汤味道不错，酸辣爽口，海鲜有好几样。","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3461348820","user":"Z**","time":"9月22日","star":3.5,"text":"工作日的中午饭点，都满员了。店里位置挺多，但是比较紧凑间距很小。「招牌去骨海南鸡」鸡肉是去大骨的，吃起来很方便。鸡皮滑爽鸡肉软嫩，搭配的酱汁也很不错，就是第二次加的酱油会有点回苦。「黄咖喱牛腩」牛肉软烂咖喱是椰香带甜口的。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/2-R8LN2Cp9R63njYF-tZQDWl4A_6pUOZuBr8MbP-GHOA3p2d3XSVQmEcH9UYMGI_Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/PNybE6F377FB9VV0Y_NkWgfurzNgCo8IhfW7RFWUZFxWLDCMoYn-UqiMGu2ZejJ4Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/0t_yiEJWpZOhfZaIWQ7dARi4x5ttCvfBejAd2ffajfQZjY94xsks_ye3tS30UwCWElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3461043922","user":"i**","time":"9月22日","star":4,"text":"说是新加坡官方政府推荐菜，便来尝尝\n属于很典型的商场工作日午餐\n之前在新马待过一段时间，看菜名感觉很正宗\n但是总体来说还是不如在新马吃得好吃\n「招牌去骨海南鸡」这个鸡冷冷的，感觉是在冰箱里放了一段时间，但酱汁还是很好吃的\n「蛋黄鱼皮」这个略微有点咸，但还是很好吃的，相对推荐\n总的来说，感觉就是典型的商场菜，不必抱很大期待，也不会难吃","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/BC1T5hL3FF_q-3-aFI-GtOUNtc6wG6BnoMi31-GkM24f-XAbWVcXsbTWO6GPh_rqElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3460798469","user":"J**","time":"9月22日","star":3.5,"text":"位置在木星，蛮好找的，工作日晚上7点多店里没什么人，上菜很快，鸡肉和菜都是凉的，不过米饭是热的。味道中规中矩，分量稍微少了点，鸡肉去了皮健身人表示吃不饱额。\n服务不错，有求必应\n店里环境其实还不错，特别是电扇的造型很好看","likes":1,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/7nBVo10ahRbZyNcL7ql6HmDGvENUC4xMQ0pWdsCPhQ1-KD-nhepyxOE9SiVw2KmgElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3460638026","user":"白**","time":"9月21日","star":4.5,"text":"环境：店面整洁，桌椅摆放整齐，是欢迎，的比较亮堂的店面\n「招牌去骨海南鸡」第一口的感觉是这个鸡非常有鸡味，鸡肉皮脆弹、鸡肉本身很嫩，配的三种酱汁各有特色。最喜欢的是甜辣酱，其次是像是浓稠酱油的酱汁，拌饭或者配鸡吃都很绝。\n蛮推荐的，好吃！\n柠檬茶就一般般，不是很甜，但是柠檬味也不浓，喝着类似统一冰红茶。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/GrUOdpV1EUVJj6AzVORVMPc4fhtHqoBwKKXsYZjmwR55vCBHXoZKqYdZtplSofAEElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/YF2ht5WUahNt8p553R6PyiFfdaGmAsajLNoJ4_VUnWAcngnD7AK_sjqEk8UX47ZKElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/abp6Eo3e2fRYgGB6mrdOQ0EwzQI8YwDYVD4j6_pUzCtXThinpDFrWRFipjtP0HhoElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/JAhx22Yv0lwpuPrRL5vT6tcIfuYgP1YnbJS278Ga02GUZCL7GyCmA_cT5qTsHI6AElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3460438337","user":"m**","time":"9月21日","star":5,"text":"来打包了海南鸡饭回家吃，回家把鸡的部分放冷藏冰了一会儿。鸡肉是一整只脱骨鸡腿，皮弹肉嫩，好吃。工作日下午店里没什么人，两个服务员都很热情，即使我打包还是倒了柠檬水请我坐下等。这个很适合做工作餐，下次来尝尝别的菜","likes":0,"images":[]},{"id":"3459329543","user":"匿**","time":"9月21日","star":5,"text":"口味：超喜欢鸡油饭，又香又软糯，单吃米饭都觉得很好吃，海南鸡非常嫩，有一种入口即化的感觉，蘸上料汁味道更好，量还是蛮多的，鸡皮很厚，所好吃但是吃多了有点腻，鸡肉下面垫的黄瓜就起到解腻的作用了，冻柠茶是套餐里送的，无功无过","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/l6dvW8t_jE6dX30oOkXlEgVdZgYtWYGT1ZXyfdg4rALqJuuM87DnC0uIVx2EpQU8Elc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/D9oS6q9fnGZIWwOvI-CP25CYY7Hu9IdBfmD8dfd7eyD8x2OVur3RygXZ40jHihKdElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/-9_jmLo8Nj-MjSUPKO7ep_VnMRLxtUTFxYO-c2YR1UUOh78dpX7ZWu8qdRzk2WhYElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3458692206","user":"大**","time":"9月20日","star":4.5,"text":"新吉小馆开在陆悦天地木星店，主打新加坡融合菜，整体很适合朋友小聚。海南鸡饭皮滑肉嫩，鸡饭香而不腻；叻沙拉面椰香浓郁，辣度友好；黑椒蟹/虾类菜品锅气足，配饭一绝。想吃东南亚风味又不想太重口的朋友们，可以去试试。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/CHU0_CHTrF0g1_SQ9VTRkTFlRW113NGZNmpjCRCH9WcnrXhxIuS_Ute_1BiRDuoVElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3458853979","user":"珍**","time":"9月20日","star":4,"text":"口味：\n「招牌去骨海南鸡」蛮多汁的，鸡很嫩\n「泰式打抛饭」爆炒蛮香，也不会特别干吧，实际比照片看着好吃。\n环境：不错\n服务：服务员很热情，有求必应\n性价比：套餐性价比高，比单点更划算\n👫🏻排队：周末中午不排队。","likes":0,"images":["https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/7GIV0kGVJ-rrimTuIVeLEmZkfOhw6V8swCOrApclRrjS8CWkZmdNZ7rahciGzYJgElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp","https://qcloud.dpfile.com/pc/45_KudPEG8G7SaLWUvDKIs5SOaLYTqw2DEsDOD4GLnHoL7vTrId9I0_7c-rOMOuBElc2-txFTxviA6n_fOE9QbySwTzJ2xmopuuSZkH1lSE.webp"]},{"id":"3458463465","user":"s**","time":"9月2